        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>三角形的稳定性</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 552px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 45px 10px 45px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .indent { text-indent: 2em; }\n\n  /* 图 11.1-8 区域 */\n  .fig-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    margin: 10px 0 0 0;\n  }\n  .fig-item { text-align: center; }\n  .caption {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .fig-number {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    color: #333;\n    margin: 6px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\n    background: #f4f4f4;\n    color: #777;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 4px;\n  }\n\n  /* 练习框 */\n  .exercise {\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    border: 1.5px dashed #f0b429;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 22px 20px 14px 20px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .exercise-label {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -14px;\n    left: 22px;\n    background: #f0a92e;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    padding: 3px 18px;\n    border-radius: 13px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .exercise p { font-size: 12.5px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .shape-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    row-gap: 14px;\n    justify-items: center;\n  }\n  .shape-cell { text-align: center; }\n  .shape-cell .num { font-size: 11.5px; margin-top: 4px; }\n\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 16px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #b8b8b8;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .footer .chapter { margin-right: 24px; letter-spacing: 1px; }\n  .footer .pageno { font-size: 15px; color: #e08a00; font-weight: bold; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <p class=\"indent\">还可以发现，斜钉一根木条的四边形木架的形状不会改变．这是因为斜钉一根木条后，四边形变成两个三角形，由于三角形有稳定性，斜钉一根木条的窗框在未安装好之前也不会变形．</p>\n\n  <p class=\"indent\">三角形的稳定性有广泛的应用，图 11.1-8 表示其中一些例子．你能再举一些例子吗？</p>\n\n  <div class=\"fig-row\">\n    <div class=\"fig-item\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:150px;height:100px;\">[Photo: 钢架桥, 左侧]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">钢架桥</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fig-item\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:170px;height:110px;\">[Illustration: 起重机, 右侧]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">起重机</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"fig-number\">图 11.1-8</div>\n\n  <p class=\"indent\">四边形的不稳定性也有广泛的应用，图 11.1-9 表示其中一些例子．</p>\n\n  <div class=\"fig-row\">\n    <div class=\"fig-item\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:160px;height:110px;\">[Illustration: 活动挂架, 左侧]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">活动挂架</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fig-item\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:175px;height:125px;\">[Photo: 伸缩门, 右侧]</div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">伸缩门</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"fig-number\" style=\"margin-left:-40px;\">图 11.1-9</div>\n\n  <div class=\"exercise\">\n    <div class=\"exercise-label\">练习</div>\n    <p>下列图形中哪些具有稳定性？</p>\n    <div class=\"shape-grid\">\n      <div class=\"shape-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:110px;height:52px;\">[Diagram: 平行四边形含一条对角线]</div>\n        <div class=\"num\">(1)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100px;height:52px;\">[Diagram: 矩形含一条中线]</div>\n        <div class=\"num\">(2)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:100px;height:52px;\">[Diagram: 五边形（房屋形）]</div>\n        <div class=\"num\">(3)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:110px;height:60px;\">[Diagram: 四边形含一条对角线]</div>\n        <div class=\"num\">(4)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:110px;height:60px;\">[Diagram: 六边形含一条对角线]</div>\n        <div class=\"num\">(5)</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shape-cell\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"width:105px;height:60px;\">[Diagram: 六边形分割成六个三角形]</div>\n        <div class=\"num\">(6)</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <span class=\"chapter\">第十一章　三角形</span>\n    <span class=\"pageno\">7</span>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
